aussian Splatting）渲染生成的图像训练，具有极强的 3D 空间逻辑。\n\n二、 96 个视角指令拆解视角由以下三个维度的参数排列组合而成（8 X 4 X 3 = 96）：\n1. 方位角（Azimuth）- 决定环绕角度（共 8 个）控制相机围绕人物水平旋转的位置：\nfront view (0°)\nfront-right view (45°)\nright view (90°)\nback-right view (135°)\nback view (180°)\nback-left view (225°)\nleft view (270°)\nfront-left view (315°)\n\n2. 仰角（Elevation）- 决定垂直高度（共 4 个）控制相机的高低透视：\n\nlow-angle shot (-30°)：极具冲击力的底角度仰拍。\neye-level shot (0°)：平视视角。\nhigh-angle shot (30°)：常规俯拍。\nbird's-eye view (60°)：上帝视角/深俯拍。\n\n3. 距离（Distance）- 决定景别（共 3 个）控制相机的远近：\n\nclose-up shot：特写。\nmedium shot：中景。\nwide shot：全景/远景。\n\n三、 实战示例（如何拼写提示词）你可以直接在 Qwen-Edit 的提示词框中组合上述指令：\n极致张力打斗（仰拍全景）：<sks> low-angle shot wide shot front view \n侧后方追逐特写（俯拍）：<sks> high-angle shot close-up shot back-right view \n标准角色展示（平视）：<sks> eye-level shot medium shot front view "], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [588.2000122070312, 410.29998779296875], "pos": [433.5377197265625, 1312.5361328125], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["说明：\n总共有3个控制杆，1个控制相机围绕人物水平旋转的位置\n\n1个控制垂直高度（共 4 个）控制相机的高低透视\n\n1个控制控制相机的远近"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [387.5205078125, 138.6593780517578], "pos": [681.5523071289062, 2287.46533203125], "id": 37, "properties": {}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [451.54840087890625, 547.0093994140625], "pos": [3765.026611328125, 1193.6290283203125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 578, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R":